<title>USA: TABLE - Robinson Nugent Inc Q4 June 30 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Robinson Nugent Inc Q4 June 30 net.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ALBANY, Ind. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>				 3 Months Ended	12 Months Ended</p>
<p>				  6/30/97  6/30/96   6/30/97  6/30/96</p>
<p> Sales			  21,966  19,239     84,840  80,964</p>
<p> Gross profit		  4,957   1,083     19,109  15,360</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative expenses  3,884   5,011     15,348  16,749</p>
<p> Pretax income (loss)	1,241  (3,899)     3,849  (1,694)</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     876  (3,235)     2,355  (2,159)</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>   per share		    0.18   (0.63)	0.48   (0.40)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>   shares outstanding	4,924   5,172	4,911   5,333</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1997 results include $500,000 income from patent infringement settlement and a charge of $250,000 to reduce carrying value of facility in Delemont, Switzerland.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 results included $2.1 million or $0.40 a share charge to reduce carrying values of various production equipment, elimination of goodwill related to a European subsidiary and personnel and workforce reduction charges.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
